nt to have context bloat. So you kind of want to start fresh. And so it seems like starting a new, you know, fast assistant for a new kind of context mean is exactly what, you know, well, whether we pre-make them or make them, I think making them on demand. So only when, you know, like the dictate button is pushed, then if there isn't currently a fast assistant, we make one. Um, I don't think we need to, every time a new page is made, we automatically uh, create, you know, a bunch of agents that just sit around and potentially never do anything. So, you know, add that to, well, send that, that, you know, issue through to the uh, system designer so we can at least make note and try and optimize for that."}
